From c2a34da24956f3d242ee2e11f25f7035b2bc07f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ramanathan Choodamani <quic_rchoodam@quicinc.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Oct 2024 22:56:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] wifi: mac80211: Add percpu queues for utility functions

Use percpu SW queues and variables for all
the utility functions that involve stopping and waking up
the queues and add SKBs to this pending queue which is no
longer shared between different CPUs.

Signed-off-by: Ramanathan Choodamani <quic_rchoodam@quicinc.com>
---
